+**Veterinarian directory**: The clinic's published list of the Veterinarians it employs and the Specialties each holds, offered both as a page for readers and in a machine-readable form for other software. Relationships: The directory covers every Veterinarian; a reader may narrow it to one Specialty. Both forms carry the same veterinarians. Avoid: Vet registry, Vet catalog, Vet search (the directory is filtered by a whole Specialty name, not searched).
