+	/**
+	 * Retrieve the <code>Vet</code>s holding the named specialty. The whole name must
+	 * match, disregarding letter case; a partial name matches no <code>Vet</code>. Case
+	 * folding is stated in the query rather than left to the column collation, so the
+	 * result is the same on H2, PostgreSQL and MySQL.
+	 * <p>
+	 * Deliberately not <code>@Cacheable</code>: the argument is caller-supplied text from
+	 * an unauthenticated request, and the "vets" cache is unbounded and never evicted.
+	 * See docs/adr/2026-08-26-uncached-specialty-filtered-vet-lookups.md.
+	 * @param name the whole specialty name to match, disregarding case
